{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>For the sons of Joseph.</b> After the sons of Leah, on account of the honor of Rachel over the maidservants. And he began with Ephraim, following the way of Jacob our father. And he placed Ephraim and Manasseh before Benjamin, for they are in the place of Joseph. And afterward he began with Dan, for he is the firstborn of the maidservants. And after him Asher, for HaShem knew that he would be head of those encamping under the standard of Dan. And afterward Gad, for he is the firstborn of Leah's maidservant."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:15:54.328953488Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}